{
  "slug": "liquid-glass-carousel",
  "name": "Liquid Glass Carousel",
  "description": "Componentry's liquid-glass carousel, original code: an endless photo row seen through a WebGL lens (three.js + GSAP) that swirls the image at its rim, splits it into colour and glows with a ring; drag, flick, scroll or use the arrows, click the middle photo to focus it. Copia adds `lens` overrides, `lensColor` and `autoplay`.",
